{
    "title": "Shiloh & Bros Impostor Chase",
    "description": "This is Shiloh & Bros Impostor Chase! The Shiloh & Bros crew are ready for an epic showdown of Crew X Impostor in their very own mobile game! Play as your favorite family member and get your tasks done as the Crew OR stop them as the Impostor!\r\n\r\nCREW OR IMPOSTOR - Shiloh, Elijah, Mary, Judah, Daniel, Micah, Britney, and Josiah have tasks to do but surprise, surprise - there's an Impostor among them! Join the crew as a Friend and finish your tasks OR become the Impostor and cause mayhem!\r\n\r\n*NEW GAME MODES* Introducing Pirates Aboard, Space Invasion, Robot on the Loose, & Zombie Attack! All new games to play! \r\n\r\n*NEW FEATURE - DAILY TASKS!* Introducing our new system Daily Tasks, play daily, and complete amazing objectives to win rewards!\r\n\r\nLOOK GOOD - Collect Outfits to customize your Crewmate. From the most fashionable cactus or burger for your head, to the Mini Crewmate!!\r\n\r\nGEAR UP - What better way to wreak havoc as an Impostor than to chase everyone with a frying pan or to clobber them with a stop sign.\r\n\r\nEPIC BEDROOM - Style your bedroom the way you want, and watch Shiloh and the gang throw down some sweet dance moves.\r\n\r\nJoin the crew and play Shiloh & Bros Impostor Chase now!",
    "descriptionHTML": "This is Shiloh &amp; Bros Impostor Chase! The Shiloh &amp; Bros crew are ready for an epic showdown of Crew X Impostor in their very own mobile game! Play as your favorite family member and get your tasks done as the Crew OR stop them as the Impostor!<br><br>CREW OR IMPOSTOR - Shiloh, Elijah, Mary, Judah, Daniel, Micah, Britney, and Josiah have tasks to do but surprise, surprise - there&#39;s an Impostor among them! Join the crew as a Friend and finish your tasks OR become the Impostor and cause mayhem!<br><br>*NEW GAME MODES* Introducing Pirates Aboard, Space Invasion, Robot on the Loose, &amp; Zombie Attack! All new games to play! <br><br>*NEW FEATURE - DAILY TASKS!* Introducing our new system Daily Tasks, play daily, and complete amazing objectives to win rewards!<br><br>LOOK GOOD - Collect Outfits to customize your Crewmate. From the most fashionable cactus or burger for your head, to the Mini Crewmate!!<br><br>GEAR UP - What better way to wreak havoc as an Impostor than to chase everyone with a frying pan or to clobber them with a stop sign.<br><br>EPIC BEDROOM - Style your bedroom the way you want, and watch Shiloh and the gang throw down some sweet dance moves.<br><br>Join the crew and play Shiloh &amp; Bros Impostor Chase now!",
